ngle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{5\\pi }{12}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{12})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{12}) & =cos\\,(2\\cdot \\frac{5\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =cos\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266303 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266304 13194139533926 true] [17592186266303 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533926 true] [17592186266303 1041 "field-1" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266303 1104 #edb/ref 17592186266304 13194139533926 true] [17592186266303 1110 #uuid "8efdf1f1-b048-56ed-9750-68262ca3705d" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266304 1034 "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266304 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533926 true] [17592186266304 1111 #uuid "6cea964b-7c43-5282-bd68-8059398cb620" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266305 1017 #edb/ref 17592186266306 13194139533926 true] [17592186266305 1089 "q-332151" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266305 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533926 true] [17592186266305 1100 "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n${cos}^{4}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-2{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}){sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+{sin}^{4}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266305 1113 #uuid "224973b3-4d0f-5f60-b8d7-c480ae784416" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266305 1145 "First, notice that our expression is a perfect square that can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{4}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-2{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}){sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+{sin}^{4}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) & ={({cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}))}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) & =cos\\,(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}))}^{2} & ={0}^{2}=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266306 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266307 13194139533926 true] [17592186266306 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533926 true] [17592186266306 1041 "field-1" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266306 1104 #edb/ref 17592186266307 13194139533926 true] [17592186266306 1110 #uuid "35cad5cc-3e40-55af-9fbd-56ee1889a1c5" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266307 1034 "0" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266307 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533926 true] [17592186266307 1111 #uuid "92e97f9f-d3a8-5820-9737-fe74cda49173" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266308 1017 #edb/ref 17592186266309 13194139533926 true] [17592186266308 1089 "q-7692" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266308 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533926 true] [17592186266308 1100 "Express $2{cos}^{2}⁡{22}^{∘}-1$ as a single trigonometric ratio." 13194139533926 true] [17592186266308 1113 #uuid "69a7ca9e-fd71-55ad-91ce-07744b83a69e" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266308 1145 "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n2{cos}^{2}⁡x-1=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={22}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{cos}^{2}⁡{22}^{∘}-1 & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\cdot {22}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{44}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533926 true] [17592186266309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266310 13194139533926 true] [17592186266309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266311 13194139533926 true] [17592186266309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266312 13194139533926 true] [17592186266309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266313 13194139533926 true] [17592186266309 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266314 13194139533926 true] [17592186266309 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533926 true] [17592186266309 1041 "